three vacations or two?

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.860
My friend, every dollar you
put back into your business

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.490
gives you the potential to have

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.243
that business be healthier, longterm.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.900
I believe this entire conference,

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.860
and this entire space is "broken".

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:49.820
