that isn't actually practical

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.010
to the reality of the business.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.820
Most people start businesses
to take the money out

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.530
to buy themselves things,

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.720
which is why they never build
long term big businesses.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.840
You have to understand,
there's a fundamental reason

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.270
I have the career that I have.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:05.230
The only thing I am is
energy for the longterm.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.960
When you can "oversell" your reality,

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.580
but then build to the new reality,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.957
that's how you get big.

00:01:10.957 --> 00:01:14.550
For VaynerMedia I was able
to, over the last five years,

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.560
grow us from 22 people to 800 people,

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:20.610
from 3 million to 100 million in revenue,

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.250
because I can continue to do my model.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.310
We're gonna make less money
this year, at 100 million,

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.970
than we made last year at 67.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.340
Net, I don't mean percentage, net.

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.280
Historically I've liked to run them

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.033
