and the next year is not.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.430
So the growth is there,
but the non-profitable

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.410
every other year, was
predicated on me being able

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.840
to invest in people,
advertising or resources.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.480
More people, more capabilities.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.723
Because I'm gonna take
the whole fucking pie.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:53.649
99% of the market's short-term,

00:01:53.649 --> 00:01:57.530
